<title>JAPAN: Yamaha Corp names Ishimura as new president.</title>
<headline>Yamaha Corp names Ishimura as new president.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yamaha Corp said on Thursday that its executive director Kazukiyo Ishimura will succeed Seisuke Ueshima as president in June.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that Ueshima will become chairman.</p>
<p>The appointment of the new president will be formally approved at a company board meeting to be held after the shareholders' meeting scheduled for June 27, the statement said.</p>
<p>Yamaha is the world's largest manufacturer of musical instruments.</p>
</text>
